# Production deploys (Netlify)

- **Netlify auto-publishes from `main` only** (`circleoflifealf` / `Circle-of-Life`). Pushes to other branches do not update production.
- **When Brian asked for the work:** finish by merging into `main` and pushing so Netlify builds. A draft PR or feature branch is not live. See `ship-complete-to-main.mdc`.
- Prefer short-lived branches + PR into `main`, then merge. Do not leave shippable work sitting on a branch.
